      "content": "but it's not just in my head. it's tangible. i see them making sacrifices because of my mistakes or because i can't provide what they need. it feels so selfish to just keep hanging on when my existence makes their lives harder. it feels like the only way to actually help them is to just... stop being the problem. to let them move on without this constant shadow hanging over them.",
